255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">2期生のリレーブログを開始したのが12月1日…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">個人ブログが始まるのちょっと早いかな~とか思っちゃったりしたんですけど、沢山の人に私のことを知ってもらえる機会が増えると思うと、楽しみですね♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは、初心にかえり、もう一度自己紹介します🐰</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">大阪府出身&nbsp;高校1年生&nbsp;15歳</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">けやき坂46 2期生の小坂菜緒です！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">・好きな食べ物&nbsp;ハンバーグ、イチゴ、海鮮</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">・趣味&nbsp;本を読む事・本屋でゆっくり時間を過ごす</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">・苦手なもの&nbsp;虫、絶叫マシン、お化け屋敷</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">・得意なもの&nbsp;細かい作業、静かにすること</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">初めのブログの時よりわかりやすい自己紹介文になってるかな？</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">それでは最後に！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">最近よくあることなんですけど</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">\"菜緒\"の字を間違われる事が多くて、特に気にしてないんですけど、やっぱり発見しちゃうと…ね</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">\"奈緒\"じゃないです！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">菜の花の\"菜緒\"で覚えてください♪</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">これで自己紹介を終わります！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ブログのカウント数は、そのままで続けていこうと思います！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">リレーと個人と合わさっちゃうけど、一緒にしちゃいます！</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\">ではでは…</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 19.1px;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/kosaka.nao/2018-